# Build context filter for `edge/Dockerfile` (context: the repository root).
#
# BuildKit prefers this per-Dockerfile file over the root `.dockerignore`, so
# the edge build gets its own view of the context: its own config, nothing
# else. The image carries no front-end files (docker/edge/Dockerfile).
#
# Everything is excluded, then the one thing the edge needs is allowed back.

*
!docker/edge

# Never, whatever the rules above say.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
